    "body": "Six files had CRLF line endings. Main uses LF. The diff showed whole-file churn.\n\nCommit a40088d13f3f54e9f42f9736bfd7781b64331078 restores LF in these files:\n- `crates/app/src/commands/mod.rs`\n- `crates/app/src/commands/fixture_turn.rs`\n- `crates/app/src/mcp/mod.rs`\n- `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`\n- `crates/app/src/fixture_clash.rs`\n- `crates/ui/tests/fixtures.rs`\n\n`git diff -w --ignore-cr-at-eol` between the old head (a163d62e3) and the new head is empty. The PR diff against main now shows 824 insertions and 29 deletions in 16 files.\n\nNo build was run, because the content did not change. The PR stays a draft until the delta re-check.\n",
